; The one variable: how a MenuButton label that is wider than its box is fitted. MenuButton draws as
; Button does (menu_button.cpp has no draw code), so autowrap_mode wraps it at the box and
; text_overrun_behavior trims it (button.cpp:428-441). A box of 70 px is narrower than "alpha bravo charlie".

